milestone VST_CUTOVER:
  title "Pre-cutover unfinished Stage battles discarded"
  description "Exact pre-cutover unfinished targets are physically removed, replay and worker paths are read back, finished history remains readable, and the V3-only cutover point is recorded."

gate vg108 VST_CUTOVER -> VST_STAGE_READY:
  reason "Stage readiness requires verified disposal of pre-cutover unfinished battles and finished-history readback."

